OL,3,ASam Fender calls out ticket prices
OL,4,Aahead of tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Fender has said he has removed a
OL,7,Fticket category from sale after being
OL,8,Funhappy with pricing for his upcoming
OL,9,Ftour.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old announced his Proper
OL,12,FMassive Stadium Tour earlier this week,
OL,13,Fwhich will visit Newcastle, Cardiff,
OL,14,FLondon, Edinburgh, Dublin and
OL,15,FManchester in summer 2027.
OL,17,FWhile tickets are yet to go on sale,
OL,18,FFender responded to a post on social
OL,19,Fmedia which claimed to outline the
OL,20,Fexpected ticket prices.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
